system  on  different  systems because the disparate systems have
disjoint PID spaces.  Cannot handle the case where  a  lock  file
was  not deleted, the process that created it has exited, and the
system has created a new process with the same PID as in the dead
lock file.  The lock file will appear to be valid even though the
process is unrelated to the one that  created  the  lock  in  the
